  "releaseNotes": "16.1.0\n* New codes\n* Bugfixes\n* Minor new features\nFor details see:\nhttps://github.com/stephanstapel/ZUGFeRD-csharp/releases/tag/16.1.0\n\n\n16.0.3\n* Bugfix for ApplicableTradeTax\n* Bugfix for Comments\n\n\n16.0.1\n* Bugfix\n\n16.0.0\n* Almost complete support for UBL format\n* Sub invoice line support by @HenriSHS\n* UTF-8 Encoding without BOM\n* Dozens of bugfixes\nFor details see:\nhttps://github.com/stephanstapel/ZUGFeRD-csharp/releases/tag/16.0.0",
